/**
 * @defgroup zip_core Core layer
 * @brief RAII wrappers over libzip: Zip::Archive, Zip::Entry, Zip::File and Zip::Source.
 *
 * The core layer mirrors libzip's object model with value semantics. Start
 * with @ref guide_core, then see @ref pitfalls for the behaviours that surprise
 * people. Declared in `ZipWrapper/Zip.h`.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_types Types, options and utilities
 * @brief Enumerations, option structures and small helpers used by the core layer.
 *
 * Zip::OpenFlag, Zip::Compression, Zip::Encryption, Zip::Stat,
 * Zip::ExtractOptions and Zip::passwordFromEnv().
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_errors Errors
 * @brief Zip::Exception and the helpers that raise it.
 *
 * See @ref errors for what each Zip::Exception::zipCode() means in this library.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_highlevel High-level API
 * @brief One call per task: archive a directory, list files, read, extract,
 *        verify, and change passwords, with transparent encryption.
 *
 * Declared in `ZipWrapper/HighLevel.h`, built on the @ref zip_core "core layer".
 * Start with @ref guide_highlevel. Read @ref security before relying on the
 * password protection.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_hl_filters Path filters
 * @ingroup zip_highlevel
 * @brief Include/exclude patterns shared by archiving, listing and extraction.
 *
 * The exact rules, with examples, are in @ref patterns.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_hl_archive Archiving
 * @ingroup zip_highlevel
 * @brief Recursive archiving of directories and file lists, with optional password protection.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_hl_list Listing
 * @ingroup zip_highlevel
 * @brief File lists, totals and an `unzip -l` style table. None of them needs a password.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_hl_read Reading
 * @ingroup zip_highlevel
 * @brief Read one member into memory, decrypting it transparently.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_hl_extract Extraction
 * @ingroup zip_highlevel
 * @brief Safe, filtered extraction with a per-entry report.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_hl_verify Verification
 * @ingroup zip_highlevel
 * @brief Streaming integrity check of every member.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup zip_hl_protect Changing protection
 * @ingroup zip_highlevel
 * @brief Add, change or remove the password of an existing archive.
 */
